schema: "0.4"
id: npl-brutalist-43-npl-conventions-browser
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo — NPL Conventions Browser: a reference browser documenting NPL's
# prompt-syntax conventions and patterns for authors writing instructions and personas.
# Theme tenets: structure shown as machinery, zero radius, hard borders, flat electric
# accents, one hazard-yellow note block, hard-offset block shadow as the only depth.
# Palette: vermilion #ff2d00, ultramarine #1500ff, hazard-yellow #ffe600,
# white #ffffff, black #000000, surface-alt #f2f2f2.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a
    documentation / reference reading surface inside a developer tool, in a
    NEO-BRUTALIST register: dense but readable, structure shown as machinery, seams
    exposed on purpose. Flat fills only — no gradient, glow, blur, or soft shadow; the
    only depth cue is a hard-offset SOLID block shadow with zero blur. Geometric grotesk
    (Space Grotesk) UPPERCASE 700 headings; Space Mono for the tree, code, chips, and
    labels; regular-weight grotesk for explanation body. No serif. Zero corner radius.
    Borders are load-bearing, always at full strength.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the NPL CONVENTIONS BROWSER screen of
    NoizuPromptLingo — a reference browser documenting NPL's prompt-syntax conventions and
    patterns for authors writing instructions and personas — rendered as raw, structural
    machinery.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (on a pure white canvas, a hard grid, regions separated by 2px solid
    black rules): a top SEARCH BAR spanning the content, a left CONVENTION CATEGORY TREE,
    and a dominant central CONVENTION DETAIL PANEL.

    TOP SEARCH BAR: a rectangular 2px-bordered input, zero radius, an uppercase mono label
    "SEARCH CONVENTIONS" above it and a mono placeholder; a bordered "GO" button with a
    hard-offset black block shadow.

    LEFT CONVENTION CATEGORY TREE (bordered blocks, no soft pills, hard-indented rows): an
    expandable tree of convention topics in uppercase mono — top-level groups like SYNTAX,
    DIRECTIVES, PERSONAS, TEMPLATES, ANNOTATIONS, each with indented child rows (e.g.
    "HANDLEBARS", "ALG PSEUDOCODE", "MOOD MARKERS"). One group is expanded showing its
    children; the active child is a full inverted block (solid black, white text) with a
    thick ultramarine accent bar on its left edge. Tree connectors are hard 1px black
    lines, not faint dotted whispers.

    CENTRAL CONVENTION DETAIL PANEL (hard-bordered rectangle, header separated by a
    full-weight rule): a big uppercase grotesk title (the selected convention), then an
    EXPLANATION paragraph in regular-weight black body text, then a SYNTAX EXAMPLE rendered
    as a bordered mono code block on a light-gray surface with a hard-offset shadow, then a
    RELATED GLYPHS row of small hard-bordered mono chips (each a glyph plus codepoint) that
    cross-link into the glyph codex. A hazard-yellow "NOTE" callout — a solid yellow
    rectangle with black text and a black border — flags a caveat.

    PALETTE & TYPE: pure white canvas, pure black ink and full-strength borders, electric
    vermilion and pure ultramarine used flat as accents (ultramarine on the active tree
    item, vermilion sparingly), one hazard-yellow note block. Space Grotesk uppercase
    headings, Space Mono for the tree, code block, chips, and labels; regular grotesk for
    the explanation body. No serif.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: zero radius; 1-2px solid black borders on tree, panel, code block, and
    chips; the only depth is a hard-offset solid block shadow (zero blur) on the code block
    and the search button. No gradient, glow, blur, or soft shadow.

    MOOD: raw, structural, declarative — a documentation surface that shows its seams, loud
    but readable.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, rounded corners, drop-shadow blur, soft shadow, gradient, neon glow, pastel colors, frosted glass"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the browser layout — top search bar, left expandable convention category tree, central detail panel with explanation + mono syntax example + related-glyph chips"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Brutalist language — zero radius, full-strength solid black borders and hard tree connectors, flat ultramarine active accent + one hazard-yellow note block, hard-offset block shadow (zero blur), Space Grotesk uppercase headings + Space Mono code, regular grotesk body, no serif, no gradient/glow/soft shadow"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Readable documentation hierarchy on a hard grid, clear active tree state, plausible real reference tool"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, legible text and code, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "rounded corners, soft/blurred drop shadow, gradient, glow, or frosted glass present"

tags: [npl-brutalist, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup, conventions, reference]
